   "mechanisms_outside_ir": [],
   "notes": "I described LLaMA-7B (6.7B), the smallest configuration in Table 2; all four sizes are listed.\n\nThe paper states the FFN width only as a formula (\"$\\frac23 4d$ instead of $4d$\"), with no integer per config, so d_ff and the gate/up widths are left not_stated.\n\nThe following are not stated: vocab size, context length, kv heads, head_dim, norm eps, RoPE pairing/theta/fraction, biases and embedding tying.\n\nThe tokenizer is SentencePiece BPE, with no vocab size given.\n\nresidual, parallel_block=false and moe=false are inherited from the base Transformer sentence. Biases and tying were deliberately not inherited from Vaswani et al.: the paper lists only norm, activation and positional changes, and inheriting those values would be unreliable.\n\nThe final RMSNorm in the head is not mentioned in the paper. It is included as a structural placeholder with eps not_stated.\n\nCausal multi-head attention is stated, but no GQA/MQA is mentioned; kv_heads is left not_stated."
  },
